{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117336","id":3386009895,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7J0mkn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117336","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117336.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117336.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117336","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117336/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117336/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117336/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b21f5a3f07d1568cddd7118a474f1ee3eeebea55","number":117336,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Core: Fix `VariantCallable` comparison using identity instead of hash only","user":{"login":"Arthurmtro","id":55857849,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODU3ODQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55857849?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro","html_url":"https://github.com/Arthurmtro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #116141.\nAlso related to #97044, which was closed as not-a-bug but had the same underlying cause.\n\n`VariantCallable::compare_equal` compared only hashes, so two different\nVariant objects with the same contents (e.g. two distinct arrays `[]` and `[]`)\nwould be treated as the same callable. This caused a spurious \"already connected\"\nerror when connecting signals to methods on different objects that happened to\nhave equal values.\n\nThe fix uses `Variant::identity_compare` after the hash check, so that only\ncallables referencing the exact same object in memory are considered equal.\n`compare_less` had the same hash-only issue and is also fixed.\n\nIncludes a unit test covering arrays, empty arrays, dictionaries, same-object\nidentity, and different-method cases.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist